<title>USA: HSN Inc says names Jed Trosper COO.</title>
<headline>HSN Inc says names Jed Trosper COO.</headline>
<text>
<p>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla., June 26 (Reuter) HSN Inc's Home Shopping Network said Thursday it named Jed Trosper senior executive vice president and chief operating officer in addition to his job as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said the COO job is a newly created position.</p>
<p>The post is effective immediately.</p>
</text>
